      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Under the source's local factorization of zeta into a slow carrier factor and a mean-spaced local polynomial, mollification and differentiation act on different irregularities: a reciprocal mollifier targets the shared slow amplitude, whereas repeated differentiation changes the local zero polynomial and regularizes its spacing toward a cosine.",
